    "<input class=\"check\" id=\"reg-part-sponsor\" name=\"participation\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"sponsor\">\n      <label for=\"reg-part-sponsor\">Sponsor <span class=\"form__check-note\">Interested in a Title, Platinum, Gold, Silver or Supporting Partner package.</span></label>": "<input class=\"check\" id=\"reg-part-sponsor\" name=\"participation\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"sponsor\">\n      <label for=\"reg-part-sponsor\">赞助商 <span class=\"form__check-note\">有意申请冠名、白金、金牌、银牌或支持合作伙伴套餐。</span></label>",
    "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-website\">Website</label>\n    <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-website\" name=\"website\" type=\"url\" autocomplete=\"url\"\n           inputmode=\"url\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocapitalize=\"off\"\n           maxlength=\"200\" placeholder=\"https://\">": "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-website\">网站</label>\n    <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-website\" name=\"website\" type=\"url\" autocomplete=\"url\"\n           inputmode=\"url\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocapitalize=\"off\"\n           maxlength=\"200\" placeholder=\"https://\">",
    "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-message\">Brief description of interest</label>\n    <textarea class=\"input\" id=\"reg-message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" maxlength=\"2000\"></textarea>": "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-message\">参会意向简述</label>\n    <textarea class=\"input\" id=\"reg-message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" maxlength=\"2000\"></textarea>",
    "By submitting you agree the Secretariat may use your information to process your registration and contact you with updates about the Kenya-China Tea Summit 2027. Your information is shared with official event partners only as needed for registration and logistics, and is never sold. To review, correct or delete your information, email <a href=\"mailto:info@kenyachinateasummit.com\">info@kenyachinateasummit.com</a>. See our <a href=\"/privacy/\">privacy notice</a>.": "提交即表示您同意秘书处使用您的信息处理您的注册申请,并就Kenya-China Tea Summit 2027的最新动态与您联系。您的信息仅在注册和后勤需要时与官方活动合作伙伴共享,绝不出售。如需查看、更正或删除您的信息,请发送电子邮件至<a href=\"mailto:info@kenyachinateasummit.com\">info@kenyachinateasummit.com</a>。请参阅我们的<a href=\"/privacy/\">隐私声明</a>。",
    "After registration": "注册完成后",
    "Registration confirms by email. When the delegate portal opens, delegates\nsign in with that email address to update details, book a stand, request B2B\nmeetings and download documents.": "注册确认将通过电子邮件发送。代表门户开放后,代表可使用该电子邮件地址登录,以更新详细信息、预订展位、申请B2B会议并下载文件。",
    "Journalists apply through <a href=\"/media/\">media accreditation</a>.": "记者请通过<a href=\"/media/\">媒体认证</a>申请。",
